OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 1 APR
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Hildegard
OL,5,     Fof Bingen and Isabella Leonarda
OL,6,     GHildegard becomes a leader and
OL,7,     Gstrikes out on her own. With
OL,8,     GDonald Macleod.
OL,9,G1700FIn Tune
OL,10,     GKatie Derham presents live music
OL,11,     Gfrom pianist Libby Burgess,
OL,12,     Gcellist Cara Berridge and
OL,13,     Gviolinist Sophie Rosa. Katie also
OL,14,     Ginterviews the directors of the
OL,15,     Gnew QueerScore festival.
OL,16,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,17,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
